SUMMARY:Tour: Curator's Tour of "Laughing Matters"
DESCRIPTION:A guided look at Laughing Matters: Social Satire from an Unruly Age with exhibition curator Dana Cowen\, Sheldon Peck curator for European and American art before 1950. \nFree\, but space is limited; registration required below. \nThis event is part of UNC–Chapel Hill’s Campus Life Experience (CLE) program. Students who attend can scan the QR code provided at the event to receive CLE credit.
URL:https://events.ackland.org/event/12-11-tour-curators-tour-of-laughing-matters/
